---
<Base title="receipts · Privacy">
  <article class="wrap prose">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>What you type or upload to make your piece, and your name, email and US shipping address. We use these to make, ship and support your order.</p>
    <h2>Who sees it</h2>
    <p>Whop processes your payment and receives your order details. The print farm receives what it needs to print and ship your piece.</p>
    <h2>Uploads</h2>
    <p>Screenshots you upload for a Full-Colour Receipt are stored for up to 30 days.</p>
    <h2>Tracking</h2>
    <p>This site has no analytics pixels or ad trackers.</p>
    <p>Questions or deletion requests: TODO(contact-email).</p>
  </article>
</Base>
